[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2340.95, "timestamp": "00:39:00", "text": "黒いボディスーツのようなもので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2343.75, "timestamp": "00:39:03", "text": "とても美しかったので、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2346.95, "timestamp": "00:39:06", "text": "私ならできる。それで私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2350.23, "timestamp": "00:39:10", "text": "黒髪モデルに取り組んでいます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2353.349, "timestamp": "00:39:13", "text": "それを覚えておいてください。ええと、それはまさに最初の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2355.349, "timestamp": "00:39:15", "text": "モデル"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2357.971, "timestamp": "00:39:17", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "suppppppppppp"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2358.15, "timestamp": "00:39:18", "text": "えっと、ヴァレラントとかいうゲームをプレイしていた時。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2361.75, "timestamp": "00:39:21", "text": "そう、あれが私の最初のモデルだったんです。後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2364.87, "timestamp": "00:39:24", "text": "私がハイパーローラの件を始めたとき"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2368.95, "timestamp": "00:39:28", "text": "それから私はYouTubeを始めました。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2372.069, "timestamp": "00:39:32", "text": "それからストリーミングモードに切り替えたり、その他諸々の手順を実行する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2374.63, "timestamp": "00:39:34", "text": "家族に、これから"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2375.536, "timestamp": "00:39:35", "author": "@irumaVT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9ybSHxr-ali9lBPfsyuUVuKpIevGpkL17bcUltOiPnYPm0EeyQBNGQpGBfpZmwWdz7QqUrf6=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wah"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2376.71, "timestamp": "00:39:36", "text": "ストリーミング配信して、彼らは「何？」って感じだった"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2377.814, "timestamp": "00:39:37", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Iruma Vitale VT~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2378.71, "timestamp": "00:39:38", "text": "あなたはそれさえもできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2381.829, "timestamp": "00:39:41", "text": "兄弟、私を判断しないでくれ、でも私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2386.63, "timestamp": "00:39:46", "text": "これをやってください。それで私はそれをして始めた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2389.829, "timestamp": "00:39:49", "text": "1時間くらいストリーミング配信する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2392.23, "timestamp": "00:39:52", "text": "そしてそれは続き、私の両親は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2394.47, "timestamp": "00:39:54", "text": "また、良い状態にあることも確認しました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2396.79, "timestamp": "00:39:56", "text": "まるで人々が本当に気にかけているかのような反応"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2398.87, "timestamp": "00:39:58", "text": "私についてとか、そういうこと。だから彼らはこう言った"}]